| Goal ID | Goal Title                                   | Text                                                                                     | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type   | Relation |
|--------|----------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------|------------|----------|
| G1     | Manage Food Delivery and Retrieval Process   | Ensure food is delivered and dishes are retrieved efficiently.                          | -                 | Achieve    | -        |
| G2     | Handle Food Delivery                         | Deliver food to the inpatient room or allow retrieval from the robot's tray.            | OR                | Perform    | G1       |
| G3     | Handle Dish Retrieval                        | Retrieve dirty dishes from the room, possibly with cooperation.                         | OR                | Perform    | G1       |
| G2.1   | Deliver Food Directly                        | Place food directly on the room table.                                                  | -                 | Perform    | G2       |
| G2.2   | Allow Tray Retrieval                         | Enable inpatient or companion to fetch food from the tray.                              | OR                | Perform    | G2       |
| G2.3   | Track Meal Retrieval                         | Monitor and record when and where each meal is retrieved.                               | -                 | Perform    | G2       |
| G3.1   | Retrieve Dishes Unassisted                   | Collect dishes without human or robot assistance.                                        | -                 | Perform    | G3       |
| G3.2   | Cooperate with Another Robot for Dishes      | Work with another robot to retrieve dishes.                                             | AND               | Perform    | G3       |
| G3.3   | Cooperate with Humans for Dishes             | Collaborate with humans to retrieve dishes.                                              | OR                | Perform    | G3       |

### Tasks

| Task ID | Task Title                     | Text                                                                 | Relation | Location  | Number of Robots |
|---------|--------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------|-----------|------------------|
| AT1     | Place Meal on Table            | Deliver meal directly to the table.                                                   | AND      | Hospital  | 1                |
| AT2     | Indicate Correct Meal          | Signal which meal corresponds to the inpatient.                                       | AND      | Hospital  | 1                |
| AT3     | Track Meal Retrieval           | Record when and where each meal is retrieved.                                        | AND      | Hospital  | 1                |
| AT4     | Retrieve Dishes Unassisted     | Collect dishes without assistance.                                                    | AND      | Hospital  | 1                |
| AT5     | Cooperate with Another Robot   | Work with another robot to retrieve dishes.                                           | AND      | Hospital  | [2,2]            |
| AT6     | Collaborate with Humans        | Work with humans to retrieve dishes.                                                  | AND      | Hospital  | [1, n]           |

### Logical Relationships and Justifications

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [OR]**  
  Justification: The system must either handle food delivery or dish retrieval, but both are necessary for the overall process.

- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2, G2.3 [OR]**  
  Justification: Food can be delivered directly or via tray retrieval, with tracking required in either case.

- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2, G3.3 [OR]**  
  Justification: Dishes can be retrieved unassisted, with robot cooperation, or human cooperation.

- **G2.2 -> AT2, AT3 [AND]**  
  Justification: Indicating the correct meal and tracking are both required for tray retrieval.

- **G3.2 -> AT5 [AND]**  
  Justification: Retrieving dishes with another robot requires collaboration, hence AND decomposition.

- **G3.3 -> AT6 [AND]**  
  Justification: Collaborating with humans for dish retrieval involves a single task but may involve multiple robots.

This goal model ensures that the system efficiently handles both food delivery and dish retrieval, considering various cooperation scenarios and tracking requirements.
